WEBVTT

00:09:29.899 --> 00:09:32.268
self-reflection and work.

00:09:32.302 --> 00:09:34.938
And that kind of questioning, I think,

00:09:34.971 --> 00:09:38.441
is something that I find it
helpful to be offline

00:09:38.475 --> 00:09:40.677
because I'm like, otherwise,
I'm just listening

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.312
to what everybody else is saying.

00:09:42.312 --> 00:09:45.215
Like, are these my thoughts
and my feelings

00:09:45.248 --> 00:09:47.450
or am I just internalizing

00:09:47.484 --> 00:09:50.086
what other people are just shouting
into the atmosphere

00:09:50.086 --> 00:09:51.287
and into the internet?

00:09:51.287 --> 00:09:54.357
I think, there's moments where obviously,

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.826
a lot the uprisings in June
would not have happened

00:09:56.826 --> 00:09:59.095
if it wasn't for the information
that was shared

00:09:59.129 --> 00:10:01.698
and that action, of course,
was so important.